      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The government MUST prioritize aggressive decarbonization because climate catastrophe poses an existential threat that will ultimately destroy the economy, making short-term recession a necessary sacrifice. Waiting for economic stability to act on climate change is a dangerous gamble that ignores the irreversible tipping points we are already facing. Prioritizing the environment is the only way to secure long-term economic growth, as the cost of inaction far outweighs the pain of immediate transition.",
      "source": "target",
